OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered early showers become
OL,6,Ffrequent and heavy for a time around
OL,7,Fmidday. Showers turn wintry from mid-
OL,8,Fafternoon. Fresh to strong northwest
OL,9,Fwinds increase to gale from mid-
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers will continue
OL,13,Fovernight, these showers will become
OL,14,Ffrequent and heavy at times with some
OL,15,Fwintry. Gale northwest winds turn
OL,16,Fnorth later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
