OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAnother day of blustery
OL,6,Fshowers, these wintry over high
OL,7,Fground. The gales will soon ease down
OL,8,Fbut strong winds continue through the
OL,9,Fday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLess
OL,12,Fcold from Friday. Scattered showers
OL,13,FFriday merge into longer periods of
OL,14,Flocally heavy rain Saturday. Early
OL,15,Frain will clear leaving Sunday dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
